using the given voxel size only using data within the \
mask.\\nRegisterData[{target, vox}, {moving, mask}] registers the data series \
using the given voxel size only using data within the mask.\\n\\nOutput is \
the registered data with the dimensions of the moving data. \\nIf \
OutputTransformation is True it also outputs the translation, rotation scale \
