ReadListData.\nMeanType[{kspace, types}, type] calcualtes the Mean of the \
kspace data on type, where type is part of types.\nMeanType[kspace, types, \
{type,..}] calcualtes the Mean of the kspace data on each of the list type, \
where type is part of types.\nOutput is {kspace, types}.", 
