    "FlipTensorOrientation[tens, perm] permutes the internal orientation of \
the tensor, perm can be any permutation of {\"x\",\"y\",\"z\"}.\n\
FlipTensorOrientation[tens, flip] flips the internal orientation of the \
tensor, flip can be {1,1,1}, {-1,1,1}, {1,-1,1} or {1,1,-1}.\n\
FlipTensorOrientation[tens, flip, perm] flips and permuter the internal \
orientation of the tensor.\nFlipTensorOrientation[tens, perm, flip]flips and \
permuter the internal orientation of the tensor.\n", 
